      "content": "Manage tags on Amazon Braket resources (quantum tasks, hybrid jobs, and spending limits) for cost allocation, IAM ABAC, and organization. Tags are propagated to AWS Cost Explorer and AWS Budgets and can be used to enforce fine-grained IAM conditions on Braket resources.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: AWS Support",
